{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 62, :comments ["<b>Coming from the approach of Beer-Lahai-Roi.</b> Not coming from Beer-Lahai-Roi, but from its border — like מלבא חמת, 'from the approach of Hamath.' It is as though written מן בא, and בא here means the entrance of the city, like 'show us now the entrance of the city' (הראנו נא מבוא העיר). And the mem in מבוא is like the mem of מתום, which is like תום."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:42.275199513Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}